From: K2B_RetroArch
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: kickpi-k2b: disable the eMMC slot

The eMMC is optional on the K2B and not fitted on the board this image
targets: every boot logged "mmc2: Failed to initialize a non-removable
card" 15 ms after the controller came up (nothing answers CMD0). The
image boots and runs from microSD only; eMMC is not supported.

---
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun50i-h618-kickpi-k2b.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun50i-h618-kickpi-k2b.dts
@@ -253,9 +253,9 @@
 	};
 };
 
-/* eMMC */
+/* eMMC: not fitted on the K2B this image targets, and not supported (0065) */
 &mmc2 {
-	status = "okay";
+	status = "disabled";
 	bus-width = <8>;
 	cap-mmc-hw-reset;
 	mmc-hs200-1_8v;
